 "final_url": "https://www.bolna.ai/",
 "title": "Bolna AI \u2013 Voice AI Agents for Indian Languages",
 "meta_description": "Bolna AI builds voice AI agents in 20+ languages. Automate support, sales and recruitment calls in Hindi, Hinglish, Tamil, Telugu and more.",
 "text": "Symphony 2026 \u2014 India\u2019s biggest Voice AI summit. Early bird tickets now live.\nHow it Works\nFeatures\nIntegrations\nAgents\nCase Studies\nPricing\nNews\nDocs\nCareers\nLogin\nBook a Demo\nBacked by\nBolna AI:\nVoice AI\nBuilt for India\n\nBolna AI voice agents power thousands of inbound and outbound calls\nevery minute with human-like, multilingual intelligence\n\nExperience Bolna\n1000+ Companies rely on Bolna to power their Voice AI Stack across\n10+ vernacular Indian languages including Hinglish, Hindi, Tamil, Telugu.\nBOLNA FOR ENTERPRISES\n\nSeamlessly Build, Test, Deploy, and Scale Conversational Voice AI Agents.\nGo from idea to live calls in minutes, not weeks.\n\nCONTACT US\nTalk to Bolna\n\nHave questions? Give our AI Agent a call and we'll help you get started.\n\n+91 22 6953 9260\nOUR AGENTS\nAgents That Do More Than Just Talk\n\nCreate Voice AI agents for India that sound natural, understand context\nand take action that business oriented results without increasing your team size.\n\nBFSI\nEcommerce\nEdTech\nHealthTech\nHospitality\nReminders Agent\nReminders\nEnglish + Hindi\n\nAutomates all reminders, from EMIs and collections to form filling deadlines\n\nPlay Demo\nClone Agent\n+918035317402\nCustomer Support Agent\nCustomer Support\nEnglish\n\nProvides 24/7 inbound call answering for FAQs and customer triage\n\nPlay Demo\nClone Agent\n+918035317400\nLead Qualification Agent\nLead Qualification\nHindi\n\nCalls every lead to ask qualifying questions, answer FAQs, and warmly introduces the business\n\nPlay Demo\nClone Agent\n+918035317443\nAnnouncements Agent\nAnnouncements\nEnglish + Hindi\n\nKeeps users engaged with all feature upgrades and product launches\n\nPlay Demo\nClone Agent\n+918035317403\nHOW IT WORKS\nBuilt for Developers,\nEasy for Everyone\n\nWhether you're a no-code builder or a developer, Bolna makes it easy to create powerful conversational voice AI agents that understand Indian languages and accents. Build and scale multilingual voice bots using simple clicks or code control.\n\nNO-CODE PLAYGROUND\n\nSTEP ONE\n\nConnect Account\n1\n\nSign in to the Dashboard\n\nSTEP TWO\n\nConfigure Agent\n2\n\nChoose a pre-built template or build from scratch\n\nSTEP THREE\n\nClick to Call\n3\n\nTrigger calls, campaigns or connect agent with your phone number\n\nDEVELOPER APIs\napi-integration\nPython\nJavaScript\ncURL\n1import requests\n2\n3url = \"https://api.bolna.ai/call\"\n4\n5payload = {\n6    \"agent_id\": \"123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426655440000\",\n7    \"recipient_phone_number\": \"+10123456789\",\n8    \"from_phone_number\": \"+19876543007\",\n9    \"user_data\": {\n10        \"variable1\": \"value1\",\n11        \"variable2\": \"value2\",\n12        \"variable3\": \"some phrase as value\"\n13    }\n14}\n15\n16headers = {\n17    \"Authorization\": \"Bearer <token>\",\n18    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n19}\n20\n21response = requests.request(\"POST\", url, json=payload, headers=headers)\n22\n23print(response.text)\nFEATURES\nFeatures That Power Real Voice Agents\n\nWith integrated speech, telephony, and APIs, Bolna provides everything you need to take your idea into secure, production-ready deployment.\n\nBulk Calling at Scale\n\nRun campaigns with thousands of AI calls simultaneously.\n\nCustom API Triggers\n\nCall external APIs in real-time during a live conversation.\n\nHuman-in-the-Loop\n\nTransfer call to a human agent instantly when needed.\n\nWorkflow Integration\n\nEasy to integrate with n8n, Make.com, Zapier, and other tools\n\nMultilingual\n\nConverse fluently in 20+ languages.\n\nNatural Conversations\n\nAgents understand interruptions, reply with <300ms latency.\n\nConnect Any Model\n\nIntegrated with 20+ ASR, LLM, and TTS models.\n\nEnterprise Plans\n\nBest-in-class pricing and Forward Deployed service.\n\n100% Data Privacy\n\nIndia / USA specific data residency, on-prep deployment.\n\nModel Switching\n\nRun each call with models suited best for your use case.\n\nCASE STUDIES\nHelping Companies Scale their Call Operations\n\nExplore how top organisations leverage Bolna's Voice Agents to Streamline Internal Workflows, Improve Efficiency, and stay competitive in the age of AI.\n\nRead Full Story\n\u201cAwign automated technical screening with Bolna's Voice AI - faster interviews, structured insights, and lower costs at scale.\u201d\n17.1 Mins\nLongest Interview Duration\n6.8 Mins\nAverage Interview Duration\nRead Full Story\n\u201cHyreo improved candidate experience and reduced offer drop-offs with Bolna\u2019s 24x7 AI helpline and proactive escalations.\u201d\n96.55%\nCall minutes growth rate\n10000+\nVoice AI call conversations\nRead Full Story\n\u201cGoKwik scaled high-volume e-commerce conversations - cart recovery, surveys, collections - while answering real questions and sharing WhatsApp links.\u201d\n4,00,000+\nUnique engagements\n250+\nPeak concurrent calls\nRead Full Story\n\u201cHypothesis automated thousands of recovery calls with Bolna, recovering \u20b92.5 Cr+ in revenue with 24-hour turnaround.\u201d\n\u20b92.5 Cr+\nRevenue recovered\n300+\nSKUs live\nRead Full Story\n\u201cFutwork launched a national campaign with Bolna's Voice AI - 10K+ calls daily and seamless human escalations.\u201d\n10K+\nCalls daily\n250+\nConcurrent calls\nINTEGRATIONS\nSeamless Integrations\nView all Integrations\nEffortlessly Integrate with Your Tool Stack\n\n\nBolna works hand-in-hand with leading platforms to supercharge your communication stack. Easily plug Bolna into your communication infrastructure and scale without friction.\n\nReady to Build Smarter Voice AI Agents?\n\nConnect with our team for a personalized demo and unlock faster deployment, smarter calls, and real results.\n\nBook a Demo\nAPI Documentation\nAPI authentication\nUsing Agents APIs\nMaking phone calls APIs\nGet call data APIs\nPhone numbers APIs\nInbound agents APIs\nKnowledgebases APIs\nBatch APIs\nSub account APIs\nSIP Trunk APIs\nDispositions APIs\nProduct\nDashboard\nFunction tool calling\nPDFs, RAGs & Knowledge bases\nUsing Twilio with Bolna Voice agents\nUsing Plivo with Bolna Voice agents\nUsing Vobiz with Bolna Voice agents\nMultilingual support\nMaking bulk calls & campaigns\nAI outbound calling\nAgent library & templates\nBolna Voice agent integrations\nAI voice agents\nAI voice agent platform\nHindi text to speech\nAgent Studio\nBeta Community\nBeta Community Terms\nBolna Builders Community Showcase\nBolna Builders Slack Community\nCompany\nYC Launch\nContact us\nSchedule a Call\nPartners Program\nPricing & Plans\nBolna CLI\nBolna Blogs\nNews & Updates\nLLMs.txt\nDocs LLMs.txt\nTop Indian AI Voice Agents\nSystem status\n\u00a9 2026 Whismurwave Inc. All Rights Reserved.\nTerms of use\nPrivacy Policy",
